# Subham Travelers - Environment Configuration Template
# =========================================================================================
# OPENSTREETMAP & FREE OPEN-SOURCE MAPPING STACK CONFIGURATION:
#
# This project uses a 100% free, open-source mapping stack:
# - Map Rendering: Leaflet + React Leaflet with OpenStreetMap tiles
# - Location Autocomplete: Photon API (OpenStreetMap geocoder by Komoot)
# - Route Calculation: OSRM (Open Source Routing Machine) driving API
#
# NO GOOGLE MAPS API KEY OR CREDIT CARD REQUIRED!
#
# Attributions & Production Notes:
# 1. Map Tiles: OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL license). Attribution included.
# 2. Photon API: Default public endpoint is https://photon.komoot.io/api.
# 3. OSRM API: Default public demo endpoint is https://router.project-osrm.org.
# =========================================================================================

# Optional custom Photon Geocoding Endpoint
VITE_PHOTON_API_URL="https://photon.komoot.io/api"

# Optional custom OSRM Routing Endpoint
VITE_OSRM_API_URL="https://router.project-osrm.org"

# Official WhatsApp Direct Enquiry Contact (Country code + phone without + or spaces)
